usage: niagara_help class [-h] [-v] [--jdk] [--bytecode] name

positional arguments:
  name           Class name (e.g. BWebServlet)

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  -v, --verbose
  --jdk          Look up the JDK API (separate opt-in index) instead of Niagara
  --bytecode     Show the class from its class file (bytecode-index.json): super chain, slots
                 declared and inherited
